	(text "Load cell output sensitivity. : 2±10% mV/V => 2.2mV/V\n(V+ * Lcell) = 5V * 2.2mV/V => 11mV\nG = 3.3V/11mV = 300 V/V\n\nINA125: G = 4 + 60k/Rg => Rg = 60k / (300-4) = 202.7\nRg = 200R\nOffset drift: 2uV/Celsius"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.224 147.32 0)
		(effects
