	(text "Swagelok A Model - 2 wires 4-20mA\nRload = 100 || (1.5k + 191k) = 99.94808 <= 200\nPressure_An = Iin±5% x 99.94808 x (191k / (191k + 1.5k)) <= 3.3V\n0.37684V <= Pressure_An <= 2.08256V\n2117 ADC steps\nFcutoff = 1/2piRC = 1 / (2 * pi * (191k || (1.5k + 100) x 10u)) = 10.03 Hz\n*Manual calibration for zero (R potentiometer)\n*Manual calibration for span(range 4-20mA) (S potentiometer)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.478 75.438 0)
		(effects
